{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0374_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e8401a56bff6699efad1498d3c263cb3b453040c22d65b2b7429e6655d5c3aca", "ja": "（今日は可奈の曲『あめにうたおう♪』のPV撮影。\nリハーサルは無事終わり、次は本番だが……）", "zh": "（今天是拍摄可奈的歌曲《在雨中歌唱♪》PV的日子。\n排练顺利结束了，接下来就是正式拍摄，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0374_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "9a4a8d1969538355f2b29df73f1e8e9471ccb42a97520310dc4d2a5ccfb1c98b", "ja": "いっぱい歌えて気持ちよかった～♪\n{$P$}さん、私の歌、どうでしたか？", "zh": "唱了好多歌，感觉真舒服～♪\n{$P$}先生，我的歌唱得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0374_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7cb1b9fda1903c99099c58d74d26955e3c362d19ee4981bb3d4528ed0dd23c95", "ja": "楽しそうな歌声だったよ。\n監督も、歌ってる時の表情がいいって褒めてたぞ。", "zh": "歌声听起来很开心。\n导演也夸你唱歌时的表情很棒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0374_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "17b32d4e0544915d5bca375f895052b2946b718913e4061a1652a7b78d68f5d2", "ja": "本当ですかっ！？　えへへ、やったー！\n可奈は、とってもうれしいな～♪　えへっ♪", "zh": "真的吗！？　嘿嘿，太好了——！\n可奈特别开心～♪ 嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0374_1004_p", "source_sha256": "2837a637ba308f24f5c1d7abf6c506bed8a9c8d966e58c5f6758510350535bf0", "ja": "ただ……リハから飛ばし過ぎじゃないか？\nかなり全力で歌ってたように見えたけど……。", "zh": "不过……从彩排开始就用力过头了吧？\n看起来像是一直在拼尽全力唱歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0374_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "d8dc3ec7704ab59ce78302dc3886ed0f506e1e58e3045ec7a75af8e63147f463", "ja": "そうですか？　歌うのに夢中で気付きませんでした。\nでも大丈夫です。私、まだまだ元気いっぱいです！", "zh": "是吗？我太专注于唱歌，没注意到。\n不过没关系，我还精神十足呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0374_1006_p", "source_sha256": "deb9124fd9894726519061a75f2c43ae48c0e0b6241c3b09d1989916c6fd7bdc", "ja": "それならいいけど……。可奈のことだから、\n昨日も遅くまで練習してたりしないかと思ってな。", "zh": "那就好……只是因为是可奈，我还想着你昨天是不是也练习到很晚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0374_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "c40fbdcd2061225195c2b947784fae52a2a4cf7bb769360ff6ddfe840022df2b", "ja": "ど、どうしてそれを……！？　もしかして、\n{$P$}さん、見てたんですか！？", "zh": "为、为什么会知道这个……！？难道说，{$P$}先生，你看到了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0374_1008_p", "source_sha256": "fd4e4d518c9f55c245c1a72cd8dd72eb45985dcfb90dce55d351a82bbc653291", "ja": "やっぱりな……。", "zh": "果然啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0374_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "879e0c3b41c541b938e55c6c7c06039f18731b35ca7b670d04c80a16d971fa9e", "ja": "はれ？　……あっ！　今の、ゆーどー尋問ですか！？\n{$P$}さん、ずるいですよ～！", "zh": "咦？……啊！刚才那是诱导审问吗！？\n{$P$}先生，太狡猾了啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0374_1010_p", "source_sha256": "6acb05926e8bd56bb6535ac97887e441683436b295bdfce14046034d6494e2a4", "ja": "ずるいって……。\n頑張るのはいいけど、無理はするなって言ってるだろ？", "zh": "说什么狡猾啊……\n我不是说了，努力是好事，但别勉强自己吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0374_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "01b24f1202f3be8276c9e3d473c4ccd9d31a1e546babe48a439d9437d5498eeb", "ja": "うぅ。はい、わかってます……。練習は、その……\n今日の撮影は上手に歌いたかったからなんです。", "zh": "呜呜。好的，我知道了……练习是因为，那个……\n今天的拍摄我想唱好，才练的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0374_1012_036kan", "source_sha256": "723f0d879d498851e2c79636233dd93deefce1cec7f4a07154cc05e14b5f46ed", "ja": "私、歌には人を元気にする力があると思うんです！\nだからPVを見て、一緒に歌ってくれたらいいな。", "zh": "我觉得歌声有让人振作起来的力量！\n所以要是大家看了MV之后能一起跟着唱就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
