{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0374_1014_p", "source_sha256": "95c88355dacc96612baf26b5321ae0554bd9bf3c92269b1cf1874b50f0a4f7ae", "ja": "なるほど……。\n気持ちが抑えきれなかったってことか。", "zh": "原来如此……\n也就是说，你抑制不住自己的心情了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0374_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "a2c8df994dfab829f5203ad6554197f2c3623c524657767cd5575f02b0fee477", "ja": "はい……。", "zh": "好的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0374_1016_p", "source_sha256": "086ec7975d8dd267c6e035169e63f8c4d9074aef126f21cf8ea626530e181cec", "ja": "可奈なりに、PVのことを考えてくれたんだな。\n……本当に無理はしてないんだな？", "zh": "可奈也是按自己的想法，好好考虑了PV的事啊。\n……真的没有勉强自己吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
